# the six mana left can't pay it. Bot1 gives the payment up, the declaration is taken back (CR 508.1, 733) - both Elves
# untapped again - and Bot1 attacks with one Elves, paying {4} with the four Moxen. Bot2 takes 1; the other Elves never
# attacked and stays untapped, and Forest and Mox Emerald are left unspent.

